        "snippet": "The NHDES Geodata Portal is New Hampshire’s official open data platform for accessing environmental GIS data, interactive maps, and applications. Hosted and maintained by the New Hampshire Department of Environmental Services, the portal serves as a centralized gateway to authoritative information on water resources, air quality, wetlands, permitting, and more—supporting environmental planning, public transparency, and data-driven decision-making.",
